#: rc.cpp:26
msgid ""
"Check this option if you want to see previews of the file contents in the "
"icons."
msgstr ""
"Clitchîz cisse tchuze si vs voloz vey ezès imådjetes des prévoeyaedjes di ç' "
"k' i gn a ezès fitchîs."

#. i18n: file: folderviewDisplayConfig.ui:147
#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QCheckBox, showPreviews)
#: rc.cpp:29
msgid "Show previews"
msgstr "Mostrer des prévoeyaedjes"

